/*
  Cache-Control for the Mini App.

  index.html is now the only file in web/ (CSS is inlined, JS/CDN
  libraries are loaded from cdn.tailwindcss.com / cdnjs.cloudflare.com
  by full versioned URLs, which are safe to let browsers cache
  normally). This just protects index.html itself from the same
  stale-cache bug that hit the old separate main.css: Cloudflare
  Pages serves it at a fixed URL across every deploy, so without this
  a browser could keep showing an old version after a new deploy.
*/
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
